# Third-Party Notices

Document Utilities bundles no third-party runtime code.

- `client.mjs` imports only `@or3/plugin-sdk` (including its portable-runtime and
  host-capability helpers) and the local `./lib/transforms.mjs`.
- `lib/transforms.mjs` is a first-party implementation that uses only built-in
  JavaScript APIs. It performs no network, filesystem, or native calls; model
  calls go through the host's governed `ai.complete` capability.
- `fixtures/sample-selection.json` is first-party text written for this package.
- `@or3/plugin-sdk` is a runtime dependency (see `package.json`) and is licensed
  GPL-3.0 by the OR3 project. Its own `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES` covers its bundled
  code.
- `.authoring/` contains Node-only authoring tools that import the
  `@or3/plugin-sdk/profile` subpath. They are not shipped and never loaded by the
  plugin.
